  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "In Launch Pad some of the buttons don't redirect you correctly to a specific view.\n- [Screenshot #1] \"Friends Online\" button redirects you to the last visited view of the Social tab (e.g. last viewed profile) instead of the \"Online Friends\" Social subtab. (The other 2 buttons next to it correctly redirect to correct subviews of their tabs.).\n- [Screenshot #2] Clicking \"View More\" on any of the Launch Pad sections, then clicking a different one shows you a view of the previous one instead of the clicked one untill you click it again. (e.g. Recenty Updated Favourite Worlds into Recent Worlds. Or Recent Worlds into Recently Played With)",
